OL,4,BBig wins as Celtic, Rangers, City &    
OL,5,BHearts progress                        
OL,6,GHolders Celtic breezed through to the  
OL,7,Gfourth round of the Women's Scottish   
OL,8,GCup with a 17-0 victory over Forfar    
OL,9,GFarmington.                            
OL,11,FMorgan Cross and Casey Howe both       
OL,12,Fnetted hat-tricks, Isabella Fisher     
OL,13,Fscored four times and Amy Gallacher    
OL,14,Fbagged a double.                       
OL,16,FLauren Doran-Barr, Addie Handley,      
OL,17,FMaria McAneny and Evie Rabjohn also    
OL,18,Fscored and Forfar conceded an own goal.
